================ DATA ================
 price_ticks_rows | instruments | table_size | table_plus_indexes 
------------------+-------------+------------+--------------------
           500000 |          20 | 48 MB      | 120 MB


================ INDEXES ON price_ticks ================
           index_name           | size  |                                                          definition                                                           
--------------------------------+-------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 pk_price_ticks                 | 11 MB | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX pk_price_ticks ON public.price_ticks USING btree (tick_id)
 uq_price_ticks_source_event    | 42 MB | CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_price_ticks_source_event ON public.price_ticks USING btree (source, instrument_id, source_event_id)
 ix_price_ticks_instrument_time | 19 MB | CREATE INDEX ix_price_ticks_instrument_time ON public.price_ticks USING btree (instrument_id, observed_at DESC, tick_id DESC)


